---
Title: Specials in Lists
---

A tight list:

- Prose with an ampersand & and a hash # in it.
- A hash in code `#`, and `#project/clew`.
- More code: `$` `%` `&` `_` `{ }` `~` `^` and `a#b & c_d`.
- A [link with a fragment](https://example.org/page#part).

A loose list:

- Loose prose & more #.

- Loose code `#`.

Raw inline HTML keeps its escaping: <code>#include & more</code>.
